	quest.5962DC39E5874FB9.quest_subtitle: "青金石 + 骸骨"
	quest.5A9B2246E33065A5.quest_desc: ["Affects the amount of combs you receive whenever a bee produces honeycombs. There are 4 levels of this: &aNormal&r, &9Medium&r, &dHigh&r, &cVery High&r. &cVery High&r is what we are after.\n\nIt is found on KamikazBee and BeeBee. BeeBee is currently on vacation down below, though, so KamikazBee is our only option.\n\nTo get a KamikazBee, you need a Bee Nest Helmet. Get attacked by mobs (or shoot yourself with an arrow) while wearing the helmet for a 30% chance of having a KamikazBee emerge. It is quite fast, and will sting the aggressor (unless it's you), so better catch it quickly or use the Catcher."]
	quest.5A9B2246E33065A5.quest_subtitle: "重中之重"
	quest.5A9B2246E33065A5.title: "&a&l生产力"
	quest.5AE851B8074BC7E6.quest_desc: ["你可以将 &c红石蜜蜂生成蛋&r、&5氟石水晶&r和&e萤石粉&r投入水中，以制作一个红石水晶蜜蜂生成蛋。"]
	quest.5AE851B8074BC7E6.quest_subtitle: "发光 + 巧克力矿开采"
	quest.5AE851B8074BC7E6.title: "红石水晶蜜蜂"
	quest.5CC9CB0911954215.quest_desc: ["芦苇巢可以在任何主世界生物群系中生效，并能吸引一只石匠蜂或芦苇蜂。"]
	quest.5CC9CB0911954215.quest_subtitle: "可在任何主世界生物群系中吸引蜜蜂"
